    {
      "name": "App-Tier",
      "machines": ["app-01", "app-02"],
      "replicationGroup": null
    }
  ]
}
```
During an unplanned failover, which behavior is correct?

An Alert Processing Rule is deployed to suppress low-severity noise overnight:
```json
{
  "name": "suppress-low-sev-nightly",
  "properties": {
    "enabled": true,
    "scopes": ["/subscriptions/1111-2222-3333-4444/resourceGroups/prod-rg"],
    "conditions": {"severities": ["Sev3", "Sev4"]},
    "schedule": {
      "recurrence": "Daily",
      "startDate": "2026-01-01",
      "startTime": "01:00:00",
      "endTime": "03:00:00",
      "timeZone": "UTC"
    }
