}
```
An alert with severity Sev3 fires at 02:10 UTC in prod-rg. What happens?

A policy assignment enforces VM backup using deployIfNotExists:
```json
{
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "allOf": [
        {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines"}
      ]
    },
    "then": {
      "effect": "deployIfNotExists",
      "details": {
        "type": "Microsoft.RecoveryServices/vaults/backupFabrics/protectionContainers/protectedItems",
        "existenceCondition": {
          "field": "Microsoft.RecoveryServices/vaults/backup.../policyName",
          "equals": "DailyPolicy"
        },
        "roleDefinitionIds": [
          "/providers/Microsoft.Authorization/roleDefinitions/b24988ac-6180-42a0-ab88-20f7382dd24c"  
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```
After assigning the policy at the subscription, what happens to VMs that existed before the assignment?

A resource has two Diagnostic Settings both sending the same category to the same workspace:
```json
[
  {
    "name": "diag-01",
    "properties": {
      "logs": [{"category": "VMGuestMetrics", "enabled": true}],
      "workspaceId": "/subscriptions/xxx/resourceGroups/ops-rg/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/law-prod"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "diag-02",
    "properties": {
      "logs": [{"category": "VMGuestMetrics", "enabled": true}],
      "workspaceId": "/subscriptions/xxx/resourceGroups/ops-rg/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/law-prod"
    }
  }
]
```
What is the impact?

A VM backup policy is configured as:
```json
{
  "schedulePolicy": {"scheduleRunFrequency": "Daily", "scheduleRunTimes": ["02:00"]},
  "retentionPolicy": {
    "dailySchedule": {"retentionDuration": {"count": 30, "durationType": "Days"}},
    "weeklySchedule": {"daysOfTheWeek": ["Sunday"], "retentionDuration": {"count": 12, "durationType": "Weeks"}},
    "monthlySchedule": {
      "retentionScheduleFormatType": "Last",
      "retentionScheduleWeekly": {"daysOfTheWeek": ["Sunday"]},
      "retentionDuration": {"count": 12, "durationType": "Months"}
    }
  }
}
```
On Monday 2026-06-29, you attempt to restore specifically to Friday 2026-05-29 02:00. What should you expect?
